~ start
The Arch-priest approaches you, stumbling over the debris of the broken statue.
"On behalf of Cyr, Atash and Balhadad, and their temples, and Unut too, I thank you," he says. "We have been saved of a disgraceful spot and a vile menace this day. Know that the blessings of the gods shall be with you, and so shall the support of their Priests!"
=> END